## Spec contract awareness
`specs/services/<id>.yaml::shape` drives registrars on `fabrik apply`. Code MUST match shape — update both: DB call → `needs_database`; cache → `needs_cache`; `/metrics` → `exposes_metrics`; search → `has_search_feature`; admin UI behind auth → `is_admin_dashboard`. Contradiction = registrar skipped = broken deploy. Preview: `fabrik plan <spec>`.
